WEBVTT

00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:14,020
A CT scan on Monday showed that the cancer has grown and spread.

00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:17,660
Sometimes I am unable to keep my supplements down.

00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:20,580
Are there any other alternative forms

00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:22,700
or additional supplements that may be taken

00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,820
to help slow the cancer growth?

00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:30,060
So yeah, we should set up a time to talk

00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:33,020
because it's, you know, this supplements,

00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:36,660
I don't know how long you've been taking the supplements.

00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:39,700
Definitely, if you have trouble keeping supplements

00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:42,300
down in the form that you're taking,

00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:45,180
I think you're, I'm assuming that you're talking about

00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:47,460
the pill form, maybe you're throwing them up

00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:50,500
or it's hard to get them down to open them up

00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:53,660
and put them in a smoothie, maybe in order.

00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:56,140
Sometimes again, like that other question,

00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:59,140
you can just be irritated from the capsule itself.

00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:01,140
So open up the capsule.

00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:04,060
If it's, you're safe to open up any capsule

00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:06,260
unless it's a time-release supplement.

00:01:06,260 --> 00:01:10,020
And it would say that on the bottom, on the bottle.

00:01:10,020 --> 00:01:12,660
And there's not that many time-release supplements

00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:16,660
that we are recommending to people.

00:01:18,180 --> 00:01:19,860
But if it's not a time-release supplement,

00:01:19,860 --> 00:01:22,020
you could open up the capsule and put it in a smoothie

00:01:22,020 --> 00:01:24,020
or put it in a drink and drink it down.

00:01:24,020 --> 00:01:29,020
Typically, if you put it in a liquid that isn't smoothie

00:01:29,380 --> 00:01:31,300
or something like that, it might stick to the sides

00:01:31,300 --> 00:01:33,780
and you're really not getting much of it down.

00:01:33,820 --> 00:01:36,340
But so putting it in a smoothie and drinking this smoothie

00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:38,940
over the course of the day is probably the best way

00:01:38,940 --> 00:01:40,780
to get that in.

00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:42,780
Are there alternative forms?

00:01:42,780 --> 00:01:46,300
We've had some people that were not eating anything,

00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:48,380
maybe even had a feeding tube.

00:01:48,380 --> 00:01:52,820
So we had to use an all-liquid supplement diet.

00:01:52,820 --> 00:01:55,260
Lots of times the liquids will be in a tincture.

00:01:55,260 --> 00:01:59,380
They're not extremely tasteful.

00:01:59,380 --> 00:02:01,980
But if you have a feeding tube, you're not tasting them.

00:02:01,980 --> 00:02:03,820
But if you're drinking them still by mouth,

00:02:03,820 --> 00:02:05,900
you're tasting them, and that can make your nausea.

00:02:05,900 --> 00:02:10,900
So that does become more difficult.

00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:14,700
I would suggest, oh, try opening them up,

00:02:14,700 --> 00:02:17,460
putting them in a smoothie and sipping the smoothie down

00:02:17,460 --> 00:02:21,460
might be the best choice to begin with.

